@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:security] tenant-and-principal-from-session
The tenant key prefix MUST come only from the server's configuration, and the acting principal only
from the token authenticated by the connection's `Hello`. No request field may select or override
either; a request naming an object outside the session's reach fails with `EACCES` or `ENOENT`.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:architecture] store-trait-boundary
Only `dfs-fdb` may depend on the FoundationDB SDK. `dfs-core` and `dfs-server` reach storage only
through the `dfs-store` `Store`/`Txn` traits, so every filesystem operation stays testable against
the conflict-checking in-memory store.
